sure a licensed pharmacist perform a monthly drug regimen review, including the medical chart, following irregularity reporting guidelines in developed policies and procedures.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0758":{"code":"F-0758","title":"Implement gradual dose reductions(GDR) and non-pharmacological interventions, unless contraindicated, prior to initiating or instead of continuing psychotropic medication; and PRN orders for psychotropic medications are only used when the medication is necessary and PRN use is limited.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0760":{"code":"F-0760","title":"Ensure that residents are free from significant medication errors.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0565":{"code":"F-0565","title":"Honor the resident's right to organize and participate in resident/family groups in the facility.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0584":{"code":"F-0584","title":"Honor the resident's right to a safe, clean, comfortable and homelike environment, including but not limited to receiving treatment and supports for daily living safely.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0677":{"code":"F-0677","title":"Provide care and assistance to perform activities of daily living for any resident who is unable.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0808":{"code":"F-0808","title":"Ensure therapeutic diets are prescribed by the attending physician and may be delegated to a registered or licensed dietitian, to the extent allowed by State law.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0810":{"code":"F-0810","title":"Provide special eating equipment and utensils for residents who need them and appropriate assistance.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0727":{"code":"F-0727","title":"Have a registered nurse on duty 8 hours a day; and  select a registered nurse to be the director of nurses on a full time basis.","category":"Nursing and Physician Services Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-f0803":{"code":"F-0803","title":"Ensure menus must meet the nutritional needs of residents, be prepared in advance, be followed, be updated, be reviewed by dietician, and meet the needs of the resident.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0921":{"code":"F-0921","title":"Make sure that the nursing home area is safe, easy to use, clean and comfortable for residents, staff and the public.","category":"Environmental Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0568":{"code":"F-0568","title":"Properly hold, secure, and manage each resident's personal money which is deposited with the nursing home.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0826":{"code":"F-0826","title":"Provide specialized rehabilitative services by qualified personnel, when ordered for a resident by a doctor.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0711":{"code":"F-0711","title":"Ensure the resident's doctor reviews the resident's care, writes, signs and dates progress notes and orders, at each required visit.","category":"Nursing and Physician Services Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-k0345":{"code":"K-0345","title":"Have approved installation, maintenance and testing program for fire alarm systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0353":{"code":"K-0353","title":"Inspect, test, and maintain automatic sprinkler systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0761":{"code":"K-0761","title":"To conduct inspection, testing and maintenance of fire doors by qualified individuals.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0521":{"code":"K-0521","title":"Ensure heating and ventilation systems that have been properly installed according to the manufacturer's instructions.","category":"Services Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0920":{"code":"K-0920","title":"Ensure proper usage of power strips and extension cords.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0923":{"code":"K-0923","title":"Have proper medical gas storage and administration areas.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0625":{"code":"F-0625","title":"Notify the resident or the resident’s representative in writing how long the nursing home will hold the resident’s bed in cases of transfer to a hospital or therapeutic leave.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-k0321":{"code":"K-0321","title":"Ensure that special areas are constructed so that walls can resist fire for one hour or have an approved fire exti